cthT2ajJbAbmAD3tDjsTjYV4Vh1yToedqpADrZH2T4RslmjAyYSnQg5V2IGEgo0xOD1s1%2bv1AnwDFGW326EFUt9tnw/4fD6iLaRldpuNXCf6WXqZ9kXjXCTOeFlau%2bpDJxxnfCydsiWO4RKZlxw7E4lXVyPNLS0oI%2bVyOYyhrq5OJpfjuZ72t7oXBijzr%2b75oaC1P915nbIiWzLOI/0Es0qthr6Xl5dnZ2enNdPkenS7nRhBF4qfn5%2bPpAlJMgle0DcMxkT758IuI%2b3zMBHdqlcDy4kFoGcYCXwd9sMyLGbh0DBr%2bx1assE72AeXwlHsKVWFAXMInvLZlA1JNv%2b/Q7YHsr8o5QT4o5In%2bYUNUrJBbUUyn8THXaDlhd96dyrim5UMX1p7lV6HT/xvQWHNxFaB4Y9PYOsK5AFdgDHui58AgkBbe7tGo5FKpaOjo1ardWJior6hYW5as7jq7aVMioBlJGjrD5hVIacy5BgP2uZZSjEwMD4xDv6enh5k4DKZDNk4otvIyEjnb78pJpUh1RT3t6%2bTrc3zFsvw0JDTalOvuuR%2bo9xvMkUDEyF7p3dZE3HhNxG0z0Y8W1NWSgCET3lvb6dU2t3drTfo1Wr1kGKoRyYz6Q0ayiajDF2%2b5R6fvsOz1OSaGwlY5D59b9g8OTo2qFCoVKq%2b/v7W1lbMhRharbarq2t4eHhmbi7g8bA//ZQ0my1ud0tzs1KpnGf8XR7da%2beMIrAyEbS2eRaHAytICqVe3WTQtnUBNiCWj0fjLMtzsXSLH4YxniW3i5untb9nEnGsgyKDXM%2bwqduaVMukf4k/4wMZdyrr/hv1uTsVXkSZKMBxJEB%2bufiYiwM5AXIC5ATICZATICdAToCcADkBcgLkBMgJkBPg/1WA/wLyOjdqiAdBMAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==' /%3e%3c/svg%3e\" width=\"840\" alt=\"Starter Theme\" data-srcset=\"/assets/static/blogscreen.82a2fbd.b8b7f4e07563a1476eac52679181f796.png 480w, /assets/static/blogscreen.2b9d5bd.b8b7f4e07563a1476eac52679181f796.png 840w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px\" data-src=\"/assets/static/blogscreen.2b9d5bd.b8b7f4e07563a1476eac52679181f796.png\"><noscript><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loaded\" src=\"/assets/static/blogscreen.2b9d5bd.b8b7f4e07563a1476eac52679181f796.png\" width=\"840\" alt=\"Starter Theme\"></noscript></p>\n<p> Open your terminal, get the directory of where you want to download the starter.</p>\n<p> <code class=\"language-text\">gridsome create my-blog https://github.com/noxify/gridsome-starter-skeleventy</code></p>\n<p> After entering this command, <code class=\"language-text\">Gridsome CLI</code> will download the starter and after that install the dependencies. This may take a while.</p>\n<p> Open the project with your favorite editor, I use <code class=\"language-text\">VSCode</code> and typed that;</p>\n<pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">cd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>blog\ngridsome develop</code></pre>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">Gridsome CLI</code> has two main functionality as <code class=\"language-text\">develop</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">build</code>.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">develop</code> is make you serve the app in <code class=\"language-text\">localhost</code></p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">build</code> is make you build your app for production in <code class=\"language-text\">/dist</code> folder.</p>\n<p>After you serve in your localhost, check the app. IT'S LIVE.</p>\n<p>Check your editor; you will see the type of folders such as;</p>\n<pre class=\"language-javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">cd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>blog\nvscode <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span></code></pre>\n<p>We are ready to add a new post. In <code class=\"language-text\">content/posts</code> directory, add a file named as <code class=\"language-text\">new-blog.md</code></p>\n<pre class=\"language-md\"><code class=\"language-md\"><span class=\"token hr punctuation\">---</span>\ntitle: \"My New Post\"\ndescription: \"new blog post\"\n<span class=\"token title important\">date: 2020-08-20\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">---</span></span>\n\nI will tell my ideas in my new blog post</code></pre>\n<p>Put these text into <code class=\"language-text\">new-blog.md</code> file and save the file, it will make the page refresh.</p>\n<p>In homepage you will see, the title of the blog added into list. Click it and show the result as below:</p>\n<p><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loading\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 2560 1311' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-3ddf00f81ee959dc2305c541a3ffab7b'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-3ddf00f81ee959dc2305c541a3ffab7b)' width='2560' height='1311' xlink:href='data:image/png%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAAAhCAYAAABpwa0hAAAACXBIWXMAABYlAAAWJQFJUiTwAAACwUlEQVRo3u1XaU8iQRD13xt%2bACKJfCJiAiEs0RjjJxayASGElSsostybKDfLNcPA265yxx0VdOQaszudPLp7qquP11Vdxd5gMMBsNgOV%2bXzO0Fs%2bMnbVsmwN7fd19rG3KgHqOHlQg/TzCxLfkwiFQojFYohGo8jlckgmk7i5uUE4HMbl5SUikQjS6TTi8TjLLi4u%2bFulUmG9YDCITCbzpK/dl3Zdtd/v9xeO2REBjzr16g9cfXWLw3/DyYkLHo8HdrsdbrcbXq8XPp8PZ2dnODo6gsvlwunpKQ4PD5kQp9OJg4MD2Gw2BAIBOBwO1ieQ3qI9afv1eh2yLBtFAP%2bCVGVlO2b%2bqV3gowsrisLrqCBdta3OpZWrY95ygZdtQ96AWq3Gfk3meH19jWq1ikajgUQigUKhgGKxCFpDO79eLHOBl3MZQoCqQ4%2bXxWKB3%2b9nH7Zarez/5%2bfnOD4%2bxv7%2bPpOi6mxi05ssa1vAZDLh2y%2bXy%2bh0Onh4eOAb73a73CbTNyqE7oyAVqvFoEP3ej2MRiMOUUSIJEmYTqcMWkdRph92Bb2uYggBdFCK3eTrt7d55PN59n8y%2b1KpxH2K6dlsFqlUSiD9FLq2nSzthAD1VhlTWdy0jJkwe4VuXZb%2b9oVckiaiTd/lR9nakI23AGkyRq/TQr/bfhe/ep3HmtvrgeYZ9LtGZoJzTfxWXsXwxdA7Tj8Mt4BnD9KSWI9n/dU3%2b1ZO8OkzwbcOpPel38Ye1raAZrPJrz3lAZQBEugb9Qt3dyiJHKGXzaAp2g0RFpt/5BQW9RxAlY/HY9zf36PdbnPIpTmoXuXiNkoAHYRyAQJtcjgcch5AfarHop6KWhayEUG0aYzex0uVU0L1am4xn2EEbMoFtvVv0ZhHcAsZ3HvrGGoB/0IxCTAJMAkwCTAJMAkwCTAJMAkwCTAJMAn4Lwn4DSYIj6oOolDaAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC' /%3e%3c/svg%3e\" width=\"2560\" alt=\"Blog Part\" data-srcset=\"/assets/static/blog-inside.82a2fbd.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png 480w, /assets/static/blog-inside.cbab2cf.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png 1024w, /assets/static/blog-inside.2665e34.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png 1920w, /assets/static/blog-inside.42db587.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png 2560w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" data-src=\"/assets/static/blog-inside.42db587.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png\"><noscript><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loaded\" src=\"/assets/static/blog-inside.42db587.62fa32c060da8ebf591feda758a24826.png\" width=\"2560\" alt=\"Blog Part\"></noscript></p>\n<p>As you edit the <code class=\"language-text\">markdown</code> of the blog, you will see the changes of the result.</p>\n<p>So; basically this starter works like charm for basic editing; there is tons of starters works with dynamic CMS's like <code class=\"language-text\">Netlify</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">Contentful</code>. This starter works with manual editing markdown pages and we want to deploy it to <code class=\"language-text\">Github Pages</code> or <code class=\"language-text\">Firebase Hosting</code>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"hosting-into-firebase\"><a href=\"#hosting-into-firebase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Hosting into Firebase</h2>\n<p>Before starting into Firebase hosting, I would like to warn about that; you <strong>MUST</strong> configure Firebase Storage, before the hosting otherwise Firebase will give you an error about it. You can think like all settings are done but the hosting place is not ready until you set Firebase Storage.</p>\n<p>Start with naming your Firebase app, I choose an app like that.</p>\n<p><img class=\"g-image g-image--lazy g-image--loading\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg fill='none' viewBox='0 0 2560 1300' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cfilter id='__svg-blur-50432755bf4a1b109cdd5cb0c1764164'%3e%3cfeGaussianBlur in='SourceGraphic' stdDeviation='40'/%3e%3c/filter%3e%3c/defs%3e%3cimage x='0' y='0' filter='url(%23__svg-blur-50432755bf4a1b109cdd5cb0c1764164)' width='2560' height='1300' xlink:href='data:image/png%3bbase64%2ciVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAEAAAAAhCAYAAABpwa0hAAAACXBIWXMAABYlAAAWJQFJUiTwAAAKxElEQVRo3t1Ze1SUZRrvn92zp62OuasICIggpmKoGJqQmpmBWiha7baG9zAW5I6Upm1aarJiHlM3d5VyE5VC7igqYJriDURBSErlPgMDDMx9uPz2ed5hcBzGWyu1Luf8zvO%2b7/fO8D2/9/dcvm8eU6o0UGt0UKm1Ajx%2bFMD3qlRpgXYdfLfK8HRQHewjJRgYXmcBtbALrYFdSDXsQ6pgv7yyG4/dLwHm103nvwZxD0RA2AMQ8HPwa5DwswgIvQMBxpvXaPXCanVtd4RO3y72MXj%2bSChAkFDT7bxDcAXZqtsVoFCqIa2XCVtZVYMqQk2tBFXVtaiorBbjSrI3blaKfXWSerH